    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy Roguelike x Noah's Ark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Noah's Dilemma</i></strong> is a crew-building strategy roguelike set in a reinvented mythology of Noah's Ark inspired by Magical Realism, featuring unique placement-centric gameplay inspired by sudoku and autochess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A successful run typically takes around 2 to 5 hours to complete, with 5 to 10 attempts expected before beating the game for the first time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775160/extras/9ac3f68d69fa8886c29ab0b0abb27ce2.avif?t=1755000426\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Animal Crew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to gather animals who will also serve as your sailors. Harness their abilities, ignite synergies, and turn your ark into a swift vessel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Wild Islands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail through a procedurally generated map, venturing to untamed islands filled with hidden treasures, hot springs, altars, villages, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle the Coral-Born</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Coral-Born are hostile creatures that emerged after the Great Flood. Command your animal crew to defend the ark from their relentless assaults.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the Four Seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the Four Seas is ruled by a formidable boss. Defeat them all, bring every animal onboard to the promised land, and claim your title as the conqueror of the Four Seas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Challenges Await</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After victory, unlock 2 new playable characters, face 6 tougher quests, and activate a 10-level challenge mode designed for veteran players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play First, Lore Later</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Noah\u2019s Dilemma</i></strong> emphasizes gameplay first, presenting its story in a minimalist style. Still, every element in the game is carefully crafted to fit into a rich, coherent world, leaving room for lore-seekers to uncover its deeper mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Four sea areas to conquer, each with its own traits and governing boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ creatures, ranging from familiar mammals to deep-sea inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ encounters and events randomly woven into your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ animal natures and abnormalities to trigger risks and thrills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ animal effects with abundant variations and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ items and relics designed for strategic play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 core mission, 6 extra quests and a 10-level challenge mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh and engaging 10-hour experience for all players, with many more hours for those looking to complete the game and master every detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775160/extras/b5e79156bde8930246b50005822cb340.avif?t=1755000426\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy Roguelike x Noah's Ark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Noah's Dilemma</i></strong> is a crew-building strategy roguelike set in a reinvented mythology of Noah's Ark inspired by Magical Realism, featuring unique placement-centric gameplay inspired by sudoku and autochess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A successful run typically takes around 2 to 5 hours to complete, with 5 to 10 attempts expected before beating the game for the first time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775160/extras/9ac3f68d69fa8886c29ab0b0abb27ce2.avif?t=1755000426\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Animal Crew</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to gather animals who will also serve as your sailors. Harness their abilities, ignite synergies, and turn your ark into a swift vessel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Wild Islands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail through a procedurally generated map, venturing to untamed islands filled with hidden treasures, hot springs, altars, villages, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle the Coral-Born</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Coral-Born are hostile creatures that emerged after the Great Flood. Command your animal crew to defend the ark from their relentless assaults.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the Four Seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the Four Seas is ruled by a formidable boss. Defeat them all, bring every animal onboard to the promised land, and claim your title as the conqueror of the Four Seas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Challenges Await</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After victory, unlock 2 new playable characters, face 6 tougher quests, and activate a 10-level challenge mode designed for veteran players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play First, Lore Later</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Noah\u2019s Dilemma</i></strong> emphasizes gameplay first, presenting its story in a minimalist style. Still, every element in the game is carefully crafted to fit into a rich, coherent world, leaving room for lore-seekers to uncover its deeper mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Four sea areas to conquer, each with its own traits and governing boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ creatures, ranging from familiar mammals to deep-sea inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ encounters and events randomly woven into your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ animal natures and abnormalities to trigger risks and thrills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ animal effects with abundant variations and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ items and relics designed for strategic play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 core mission, 6 extra quests and a 10-level challenge mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh and engaging 10-hour experience for all players, with many more hours for those looking to complete the game and master every detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775160/extras/b5e79156bde8930246b50005822cb340.avif?t=1755000426\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A sudoku-inspired strategy roguelike where you build a team of animal sailors and guide your ark through perilous seas. Master tactical placement, face unpredictable encounters, and battle deadly foes as you chart a course through this reimagined world of Noah's Ark.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cNoah\u2019s Dilemma is a title that will truly resonate with players who enjoy deep thinking. It offers the logical satisfaction of finding the optimal solution within a limited space\u2014much like sudoku or autochess. On top of that, the animals\u2019 personalities are charming, and collecting and raising them is an absolute joy.\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 \u96fb\u6483\u30aa\u30f3\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3<br>",
